# Keeps apps/web/public/ present in git.
#
# Git does not track empty directories, but infra/docker/Dockerfile.web line 30
# does `COPY --from=builder /app/apps/web/public ./apps/web/public`. Without a
# tracked file here the directory is absent on a fresh checkout and the web
# image build fails with "/app/apps/web/public: not found" — locally it appears
# to work only because the empty folder already exists on disk.
#
# Safe to delete once this directory holds real static assets.
